# Offers API – REST Client
#
# Endpoints: /offers
# Purpose:
# - Promotions and discounts system for restaurant deals.
# - Offers can target specific products, categories, or entire orders.
# - Supports time-based scheduling (happy hours), priority ordering, and stackable discounts.
#
# Discount Types:
# - percentage: 20% off
# - fixed_amount: €5 off
# - fixed_price: Set final price to €10
#
# Auth / cookies:
# - If your API uses Better Auth cookie sessions, keep @cookieJar consistent across files.
# - Origin protection: include Origin + Referer headers on protected routes.
#
# Usage flow:
# 1) Run Auth login in auth.http (stores cookie in jar)
# 2) Create products and categories first
# 3) Run requests here (cookie is reused via the same jar name)
#
# Notes:
# - Replace {{offerId}}, {{categoryId}}, {{productId}} with UUIDs from responses.
# - Prices/discounts in cents (500 = €5.00 or $5.00)
# - If your API is mounted under /api, set @apiPrefix = /api

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@origin = http://localhost:3000
@cookieJar = betterauth

# If your server mounts routes under /api, set this to /api. Otherwise leave empty.
@apiPrefix = /api

# IDs (paste values from responses)
@offerId = 4cb1e040-5d3b-41b0-b82b-fb08d4e6f732
@categoryId = 
@productId = 


### List all offers
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/offers
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

### List currently active offers (based on date/time rules)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/offers/active
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

### Retrieve an offer by id
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/offers/{{offerId}}
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

### Retrieve an offer with details (includes categories and products)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/offers/{{offerId}}/detailed
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# CREATE OFFERS - Different Types
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Happy Hour - 20% off all drinks (category-wide, time-based)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/offers
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

{
  "name": "Happy Hour",
  "description": "20% off all drinks Monday-Friday 5-7pm",
  "discountType": "percentage",
  "discountValue": 20,
  "scope": "category",
  "validFrom": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "validUntil": "2024-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "activeDaysOfWeek": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4],
  "startTime": "17:00:00",
  "endTime": "19:00:00",
  "priority": 5,
  "isStackable": false,
  "isActive": true
}

### Summer Special - €5 off orders over €30 (order-level)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/offers
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

{
  "name": "Summer Special",
  "description": "€5 off orders over €30",
  "discountType": "fixed_amount",
  "discountValue": 500,
  "scope": "order",
  "validFrom": "2024-06-01T00:00:00Z",
  "validUntil": "2024-08-31T23:59:59Z",
  "priority": 1,
  "isStackable": true,
  "isActive": true
}

### Lunch Deal - Any pasta €8 fixed price (category-wide, time-based)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/offers
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

{
  "name": "Lunch Deal - Pasta",
  "description": "Any pasta for just €8 during lunch hours",
  "discountType": "fixed_price",
  "discountValue": 800,
  "scope": "category",
  "validFrom": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "activeDaysOfWeek": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4],
  "startTime": "11:00:00",
  "endTime": "15:00:00",
  "priority": 10,
  "isStackable": false,
  "isActive": true
}

### Weekend Brunch Special - 15% off breakfast items (Saturday-Sunday)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/offers
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

{
  "name": "Weekend Brunch Special",
  "description": "15% off all breakfast items on weekends",
  "discountType": "percentage",
  "discountValue": 15,
  "scope": "category",
  "validFrom": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "activeDaysOfWeek": [5, 6],
  "startTime": "08:00:00",
  "endTime": "14:00:00",
  "priority": 5,
  "isStackable": true,
  "isActive": true
}

### Flash Sale - Espresso €1 off (product-specific, limited redemptions)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/offers
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

{
  "name": "Espresso Flash Sale",
  "description": "€1 off espresso - limited time!",
  "discountType": "fixed_amount",
  "discountValue": 100,
  "scope": "product",
  "validFrom": "2024-03-15T00:00:00Z",
  "validUntil": "2024-03-15T23:59:59Z",
  "priority": 8,
  "isStackable": true,
  "isActive": true,
  "maxRedemptions": 50
}

### Student Discount - 10% off entire order (always active)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/offers
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

{
  "name": "Student Discount",
  "description": "10% off entire order with valid student ID",
  "discountType": "percentage",
  "discountValue": 10,
  "scope": "order",
  "validFrom": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "priority": 2,
  "isStackable": true,
  "isActive": true
}


### Update an offer (only include fields you want to change)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/offers/{{offerId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

{
  "discountValue": 25,
  "description": "Updated: 25% off all drinks!"
}

### Deactivate an offer
PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/offers/{{offerId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

{
  "isActive": false
}

### Delete an offer (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/offers/{{offerId}}
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# CATEGORY TARGETING - Assign categories to offers
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### List categories assigned to an offer -ok
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/offers/{{offerId}}/categories
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

### Assign "Drinks" category to Happy Hour offer - ok
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/offers/{{offerId}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

{
  "categoryId": "cc7b8f3e-43a7-4579-a7ff-02fc7edb9aad"
}

### Assign "Appetizers" category to offer
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/offers/{{offerId}}/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

{
  "categoryId": "appetizers-category-id"
}

### Remove a category from an offer
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/offers/{{offerId}}/categories/{{categoryId}}
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PRODUCT TARGETING - Assign specific products to offers
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### List products assigned to an offer
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/offers/{{offerId}}/products
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

### Assign "capuchino" to offer
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/offers/{{offerId}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

{
  "productId": "d34ee699-bd21-44d9-9d55-cd6f43bf0f10"
}


### Remove a product from an offer
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/offers/{{offerId}}/products/{{productId}}
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/


# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# TYPICAL WORKFLOWS
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Workflow 1: Create Happy Hour with category targeting
# 1. Create the offer (above)
# 2. Get your "Drinks" category ID from GET /categories
# 3. Assign category to offer: POST /offers/{offerId}/categories

### Workflow 2: Create product-specific discount
# 1. Create offer with scope: "product"
# 2. Get product IDs from GET /products
# 3. Assign each product: POST /offers/{offerId}/products

### Workflow 3: Create order-level discount
# 1. Create order-scoped offer with fixed_amount or percentage
# 2. No category/product assignment needed (applies to entire order)

### Workflow 4: Time-based discount
# 1. Create offer with activeDaysOfWeek, startTime, endTime
# 2. Offer only applies during specified time windows
# 3. Example: Happy Hour (Mon-Fri 5-7pm)
